23. Qh5
{ Now the queen swings across to join the attack, and White stays clearly on top. }
23... axb2+
{ The pawn takes and checks, and the pawns left behind are passed — no white pawn can block or stop them. }
24. Kb1
{ The king steps aside, but the pawns that shielded him are gone; he stands in the open. }
*

